NOTE: Anything under "style" and "body" can be customized to fit your environments needs.

                p {margin-top:1em}
                p {margin-bottom:0em}
                p {color:red}
                p {text-align:center}
                p {font-family:courier}
                p {font-size:100%}




""Place DoD warning banner first line here""


